#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6490 (id 0x60, record 0), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6490/0
msgid "Now THAT'S how an assassin operates...!"
msgstr "这才是刺客的手段……！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x64f0 (id 0xc7, record 0), budget 31 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x64f0/0
msgid "You're carrying too much stuff."
msgstr "你带的东西太多了。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x64f0 (id 0xc7, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x64f0/1
