msgid "then DROP it."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6670 (id 0x62, record 0), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6670/0
msgid "Please! Try to spare them if you can."
msgstr "拜托！尽量留他们一命。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x66e0 (id 0x64, record 0), budget 37 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x66e0/0
msgid "You're going to... kill those people?"
msgstr "你要……杀那些人？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6750 (id 0x7f, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6750/0
msgid "They may be the enemy, but they are still human beings."
msgstr "他们虽是敌人，但也是人。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x67d0 (id 0x53, record 0), budget 21 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x67d0/0
msgid "You've killed them..."
msgstr "你杀了他们……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6830 (id 0x65, record 0), budget 30 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6830/0
msgid "So this is a warrior's fate..."
msgstr "这就是战士的宿命……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x68a0 (id 0x54, record 0), budget 16 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x68a0/0
msgid "You killed them?"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6900 (id 0x5a, record 0), budget 31 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6900/0
msgid "You do not have to kill them..."
msgstr "你不必杀他们……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6960 (id 0x5a, record 0), budget 33 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6960/0
msgid "Did you really have to kill them?"
msgstr "你真有必要杀他们吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x69c0 (id 0x65, record 0), budget 42 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x69c0/0
msgid "Is that your only way to protect yourself?"
msgstr "那是你自保的唯一方式？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6a30 (id 0x72, record 0), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6a30/0
msgid "I suppose you'll say it's self-defense, right?"
msgstr "我猜你会说是自卫，对吧？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6ab0 (id 0xa2, record 0), budget 54 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6ab0/0
msgid "Just because they are the enemy, does not mean that..."
msgstr "就算他们是敌人，也不代表……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6ab0 (id 0xa2, record 0), budget 30 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6ab0/1
msgid "That is taking things too far!"
msgstr "这太过分了！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6b60 (id 0x7b, record 0), budget 65 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6b60/0
msgid "I'm finding it hard to believe that you were ever her disciple..."
msgstr "我很难相信你曾是她的弟子……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6be0 (id 0x70, record 0), budget 53 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6be0/0
msgid "You barbarian! Do you really enjoy killing that much?"
msgstr "你这野蛮人！就这么爱杀人？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6c50 (id 0x85, record 0), budget 53 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6c50/0
msgid "They may be the enemy, but... I cannot believe you..."
msgstr "他们虽是敌人，但……我不敢信你……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6ce0 (id 0x68, record 0), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6ce0/0
msgid "All those people...they had families..."
msgstr "那些人也有家人……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6d50 (id 0x59, record 0), budget 28 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6d50/0
msgid "Please... No more killing..."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6db0 (id 0xcc, record 0), budget 30 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6db0/0
msgid "When you're up against a wall,"
msgstr "被逼到墙边时，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6db0 (id 0xcc, record 0), budget 58 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6db0/1
msgid ""
"press <I=ATK> to tap on it and get\n"
"the enemy's attention."
msgstr "按<I=ATK>敲墙，\n吸引敌人注意。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x6f50 (id 0xcd, record 0), budget 57 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x6f50/1
msgid "press <I=ATK> to tap on it and get the enemy's attention."
msgstr "按<I=ATK>敲墙，吸引敌人注意。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7020 (id 0xd3, record 0), budget 65 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7020/1
msgid ""
"press <I=KNOCK_WALL> to tap on it and get the\n"
"enemy's attention."
msgstr "按<I=KNOCK_WALL>敲墙，\n吸引敌人注意。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7100 (id 0xdb, record 0), budget 56 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7100/0
msgid "To neutralize an enemy, put him to sleep, knock him out,"
msgstr "要制伏敌人，可让他睡着、打晕，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7100 (id 0xdb, record 0), budget 63 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7100/1
msgid "or leave him in a near-death state - whatever floats your boat."
msgstr "或留他半死不活——随你高兴。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x71e0 (id 0x87, record 0), budget 66 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x71e0/0
msgid ""
"Stay out of the water. That's beyond\n"
"the scope of this operation."
msgstr "别下水。这超出\n本次行动范围。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7270 (id 0x7f, record 0), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7270/0
msgid "Bad idea, Snake. Your gear's going to get wet."
msgstr "馊主意，SNAKE。装备会湿的。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x72f0 (id 0x6b, record 0), budget 50 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x72f0/0
msgid "If you want to go swimming, do it some other time."
msgstr "想游泳，改天再说。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7360 (id 0x69, record 0), budget 38 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7360/0
msgid "You want to go for a swim? Now? Ugh..."
msgstr "现在想游泳？唉……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x73d0 (id 0x6e, record 0), budget 49 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x73d0/0
msgid "Why don't you save the swimming for another time?"
msgstr "游泳还是留到别的时候吧？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7440 (id 0xcd, record 0), budget 47 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7440/0
msgid "Snipers will get a bead on you from a distance."
msgstr "狙击手会从远处瞄准你。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7440 (id 0xcd, record 0), budget 63 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7440/1
msgid "Just because you can't see them doesn't mean they're not there."
msgstr "看不见不代表他们不在。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7510 (id 0xbc, record 0), budget 34 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7510/0
msgid "Keep your eyes peeled for snipers."
msgstr "小心狙击手。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7510 (id 0xbc, record 0), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7510/1
msgid "A good one can hit you from a mile away."
msgstr "好手能在一英里外打中你。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x75d0 (id 0xc6, record 0), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x75d0/0
msgid "Rockets can travel a long way to their target."
msgstr "火箭能飞很远命中目标。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x75d0 (id 0xc6, record 0), budget 33 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x75d0/1
msgid "Never assume you're out of range."
msgstr "别以为你在射程外。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x76a0 (id 0xcb, record 0), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x76a0/0
msgid "Watch out for faraway enemies, too."
msgstr "也要小心远处的敌人。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x76a0 (id 0xcb, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x76a0/1
msgid "If they've got a rocket launcher, they'll start firing from a distance."
msgstr "有火箭筒的话，他们会远距离开火。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7770 (id 0x56, record 0), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7770/0
msgid "They've got rocket launchers!"
msgstr "他们有火箭筒！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x77d0 (id 0x58, record 0), budget 28 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x77d0/0
msgid "Watch out for those rockets!"
msgstr "小心那些火箭！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7830 (id 0x7b, record 0), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7830/0
msgid "Take out the guys with rocket launchers first!"
msgstr "先干掉拿火箭筒的！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x78b0 (id 0xb5, record 0), budget 62 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x78b0/0
msgid "The guys with helmets will not go down with a single headshot."
msgstr "戴头盔的一枪爆头打不倒。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x78b0 (id 0xb5, record 0), budget 15 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x78b0/1
msgid "Watch yourself."
msgstr "小心点。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7970 (id 0x6a, record 0), budget 41 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7970/0
msgid "Ah! Taking some fashion cues from me, eh?"
msgstr "哈！学我穿衣打扮？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x79e0 (id 0x51, record 0), budget 20 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x79e0/0
msgid "Nice uniform, Snake."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7a40 (id 0xb2, record 0), budget 22 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7a40/0
msgid "Sorry about the smell."
msgstr "抱歉有味道。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7a40 (id 0xb2, record 0), budget 50 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7a40/1
msgid "I lent you a dirty uniform instead of a clean one."
msgstr "借你的是脏制服，不是干净的。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7b00 (id 0x63, record 0), budget 32 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7b00/0
msgid "It's like looking in a mirror..."
msgstr "像在照镜子……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7b70 (id 0x7b, record 0), budget 63 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7b70/0
msgid "Just don't go causing any trouble while you're dressed like me."
msgstr "穿成我这样，可别惹事。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7bf0 (id 0x5b, record 0), budget 16 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7bf0/0
msgid "Hey, same as me!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7c50 (id 0xae, record 0), budget 33 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7c50/0
msgid "If you're going to dress like me,"
msgstr "既然你要穿成我这样，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7c50 (id 0xae, record 0), budget 53 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7c50/1
msgid "keep in mind you'll have to live up to my reputation."
msgstr "就得配得上我的名声。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7d00 (id 0xe7, record 0), budget 18 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7d00/0
msgid "What do you think?"
msgstr "你觉得呢？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7d00 (id 0xe7, record 0), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7d00/1
msgid "Easy to move around in that uniform, isn't it?"
msgstr "那身制服活动方便吧？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7d00 (id 0xe7, record 0), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7d00/2
msgid "It's helped keep me alive all this time."
msgstr "它一直保我活命。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7df0 (id 0x74, record 0), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7df0/0
msgid "Make sure you wash that before you give it back."
msgstr "还我之前记得洗。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7e70 (id 0x5b, record 0), budget 24 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7e70/0
msgid "Amanda? No, it can't be."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7ed0 (id 0x54, record 0), budget 23 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7ed0/0
msgid "Whoa! Look out, ladies!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7f30 (id 0x9a, record 0), budget 25 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7f30/0
msgid "A bandanna with a tuxedo?"
msgstr "头巾配燕尾服？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7f30 (id 0x9a, record 0), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7f30/1
msgid "..OK, if it's that important to ya."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7fd0 (id 0xe5, record 0), budget 34 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7fd0/0
msgid "That's no way for a lady to dress."
msgstr "女士可不该这么穿。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7fd0 (id 0xe5, record 0), budget 34 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7fd0/1
msgid "But if you need a date to a party,"
msgstr "但要是你需要舞伴，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7fd0 (id 0xe5, record 0), budget 23 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7fd0/2
msgid "I'd be happy to oblige."
msgstr "我很乐意奉陪。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x80c0 (id 0x6c, record 0), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x80c0/0
msgid "Oh, my... Are you going to invite me out to dinner?"
msgstr "哎呀……你要请我吃晚饭吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8130 (id 0x5f, record 0), budget 38 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8130/0
msgid "Whoa, what are you all dressed up for?"
msgstr "哇，你打扮成这样干嘛？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8190 (id 0x7b, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8190/0
msgid "Whoa you look like body guard! Who are you working for?"
msgstr "哇，你像保镖！替谁干活？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8210 (id 0x68, record 0), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8210/0
msgid "What are you dressed like that for?"
msgstr "你穿成这样干嘛？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8280 (id 0xa7, record 0), budget 24 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8280/0
msgid "Have you lost your mind?"
msgstr "你疯了吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8280 (id 0xa7, record 0), budget 57 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8280/1
msgid "What kind of guerilla goes around in something like that?"
msgstr "这算什么游击队员，穿成这样？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8330 (id 0x89, record 0), budget 70 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8330/0
msgid "What an irrational choice of clothes. If only she could see you now..."
msgstr "这衣服选得真没道理。真该让她看看你现在这样……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x83c0 (id 0x60, record 0), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x83c0/0
msgid "That's a rather...extravagant look."
msgstr "这打扮……挺奢侈的。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8420 (id 0x87, record 0), budget 75 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8420/0
msgid "What are you wearing there... is that... wait... is this some kind of joke?"
msgstr "你穿的是什么……那是……等等……这是在开玩笑吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x84b0 (id 0xa6, record 0), budget 28 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x84b0/0
msgid "Hey, that looks good on you."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x84b0 (id 0xa6, record 0), budget 33 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x84b0/1
msgid "Maybe if I wore one, she would..."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8560 (id 0x9a, record 0), budget 32 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8560/0
msgid "You know, that's not a bad look."
msgstr "说真的，这打扮不赖。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8560 (id 0x9a, record 0), budget 36 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8560/1
msgid "I think it's classy even on a woman."
msgstr "我觉得女人穿也很优雅。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8600 (id 0x51, record 0), budget 22 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8600/0
msgid "Looking good, Snake..."
msgstr "挺帅，SNAKE……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8660 (id 0x87, record 0), budget 59 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8660/0
msgid "Very classy. We should throw a party once this is all over."
msgstr "很有格调。等这事结束，我们办个派对。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x86f0 (id 0xaf, record 0), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x86f0/0
msgid "What the... Snake, you're our commander."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x86f0 (id 0xaf, record 0), budget 41 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x86f0/1
msgid "The least you could do is dress like one."
msgstr "至少穿得像个指挥官吧。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x87a0 (id 0xcf, record 0), budget 25 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x87a0/0
msgid "In case you're wondering,"
msgstr "想知道的话，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x87a0 (id 0xcf, record 0), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x87a0/1
msgid "no, you CAN'T take those off."
msgstr "不行，不能脱那些。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x87a0 (id 0xcf, record 0), budget 30 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x87a0/2
msgid "So don't even think about it!!"
msgstr "所以想都别想！！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8870 (id 0xc2, record 0), budget 58 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8870/0
msgid "OK, I'm sorry. I'll quit teasing you about your code name."
msgstr "好吧，抱歉。我不再拿你的代号开玩笑了。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8870 (id 0xc2, record 0), budget 34 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8870/1
msgid "Just put some clothes on! PLEASE!!"
msgstr "快把衣服穿上！求你！！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8940 (id 0xba, record 0), budget 38 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8940/0
msgid "Fine. You want me to strip down, too?!"
msgstr "行。你也想让我脱光吗？！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8940 (id 0xba, record 0), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8940/1
msgid "There! How'dya like THAT!! Huh? Happy?!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8a00 (id 0x9f, record 0), budget 28 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8a00/0
msgid "All right! No more uniforms!"
msgstr "好！不穿制服了！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8a00 (id 0x9f, record 0), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8a00/1
msgid "From now on, we're all going NAKED!"
msgstr "从现在起，我们全裸奔！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8aa0 (id 0x75, record 0), budget 60 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8aa0/0
msgid "Uh, you know, that's...actually kind of a good look for you."
msgstr "呃，说真的，这……其实挺适合你的。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8b20 (id 0xb7, record 0), budget 34 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8b20/0
msgid "Will you please not dress in a way"
msgstr "你能不能别穿得让"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8b20 (id 0xb7, record 0), budget 43 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8b20/1
msgid "that makes MSF look like a bunch of freaks?"
msgstr "MSF看起来像一群怪人？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8be0 (id 0xd8, record 0), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8be0/0
msgid "You trying to say something, soldier? OK, I get it."
msgstr "你想说什么吗，士兵？好，我明白了。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8be0 (id 0xd8, record 0), budget 56 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8be0/1
msgid "Next time I get drunk, I'll keep my pants on, all right?"
msgstr "下次喝醉，我会穿好裤子，行吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x8cc0 (id 0x97, record 0), budget 15 B
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x8cc0/0
msgid "You're a woman."
